fect has a missing dependency: 'handleMetamaskStatus'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["789"],"no-redeclare","'BigInt' is already defined.","Block","redeclared","no-unused-vars","'setCollections' is assigned a value but never used.","Identifier","unusedVar","'source' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'getPopularCollections' and 'props'. Either include them or remove the dependency array. However, 'props' will change when *any* prop changes, so the preferred fix is to destructure the 'props' object outside of the useEffect call and refer to those specific props inside useEffect.",["790"],"no-use-before-define","'finalCollectionListing' was used before it was defined.","usedBeforeDefined","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'props'. Either include it or remove the dependency array. However, 'props' will change when *any* prop changes, so the preferred fix is to destructure the 'props' object outside of the useEffect call and refer to those specific props inside useEffect.",["791"],["792"],"eqeqeq","Expected '===' and instead saw '=='.","BinaryExpression","unexpected","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'props' and 'userId'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["793"],"React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'props' and 'userId'. Either include them or remove the dependency array. However, 'props' will change when *any* prop changes, so the preferred fix is to destructure the 'props' object outside of the useEffect call and refer to those specific props inside useEffect.",["794"],"React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'handleNftFilter', 'initial', 'menuFilter', 'props', and 'userId'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["795"],"React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'props.myLikedNfts'. Either include it or remove the dependency array. If 'setLikedNfts' needs the current value of 'props.myLikedNfts', you can also switch to useReducer instead of useState and read 'props.myLikedNfts' in the reducer.",["796"],"React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'props'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["797"],["798"],"array-callback-return","Array.prototype.map() expects a value to be returned at the end of arrow function.","expectedAtEnd","no-loop-func","Function declared in a loop contains unsafe references to variable(s) 'item'.","unsafeRefs","jsx-a11y/alt-text","img elements must have an alt prop, either with meaningful text, or an empty string for decorative images.","JSXOpeningElement","'setLimit' is assigned a value but never used.",["799"],["800"],"'setInitial' is assigned a value but never used.","React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'getNFTs' and 'props'. Either include them or remove the dependency array. However, 'props' will change when *any* prop changes, so the preferred fix is to destructure the 'props' object outside of the useEffect call and refer to those specific props inside useEffect.",["801"],["802"],"React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'initial', 'props.nfts', and 'props.pagination'. Either include them or remove the dependency array. If 'setNfts' needs the current value of 'props.nfts', you can also switch to useReducer instead of useState and read 'props.nfts' in the reducer.",["803"],["804"],["805"],["806"],["807"],"React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'props.categories'. Either include it or remove the dependency array. If 'setCategories' needs the current value of 'props.categories', you can also switch to useReducer instead of useState and read 'props.categories' in the reducer.",["808"],"react/jsx-no-target-blank","Using target=\"_blank\" without rel=\"noreferrer\" (which implies rel=\"noopener\") is a security risk in older browsers: see https://mathiasbynens.github.io/rel-noopener/#recommendations","noTargetBlankWithoutNoreferrer",{"range":"809","text":"810"},"'Accordion' is defined but never used.","'Card